<urn:atm:triage:finding/S11-QA1-006>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "S11-QA1-006" ;
  triage:title "ADR-011 does not explicitly state override-first evaluation order" ;
  triage:description "ADR-011 states ATM_LOG_DIR override exists but is silent on evaluation order. sprint-S11.md says the override-first contract is 'implied by ADR-011'. Fix: add one sentence to the ADR-011 Decision section under the ATM_LOG_DIR override bullet: 'ATM_LOG_DIR is evaluated before any OS home-directory resolution; a valid ATM_LOG_DIR value bypasses home_dir() entirely.' This makes override-first ordering an explicit ADR contract." ;
